+- REQ-CAPSTONE-5440: The `.494` milestone-close capstone aggregator
+  `exp5440-v494-capstone` in
+  `python/carnot/experiment_5440_capstone_v494.py` SHALL write
+  `results/experiment_5440_capstone_v494.json` without modifying
+  `research-roadmap.yaml` and without modifying `scripts/research_conductor.py`.
+  It SHALL read the listed `.494` source context and upstream artifacts from
+  Exp5428 through Exp5439, record any missing or unreadable input, and classify
+  the milestone hypotheses into headline-ready, bounded, honest-null, blocked,
+  or missing lanes from artifact fields only. It SHALL treat the structured
+  lane as headline-ready only when the Exp5430 corrigendum is clean and the
+  Exp5431 taxonomy replication is ready with independent metrics and valid
+  local GGUF/GPU-offload receipts. It SHALL keep `hardware_speedup_claim` false
+  without matched repeated board evidence supporting acceleration, keep
+  `future_token_signal_allowed` false without authenticated backend
+  logits/hidden-state/token receipts, and set `arc_new_level_banked` only from
+  the ARC reproduction-gated artifact.
+- SCENARIO-CAPSTONE-5440: The artifact
+  `results/experiment_5440_capstone_v494.json` must emit top-level fields
+  `milestone`, `upstream_artifacts_read`, `upstream_artifacts_missing`,
+  `headline_ready_lanes`, `bounded_lanes`, `honest_null_lanes`,
+  `blocked_lanes`, `arc_new_level_banked`, `hardware_speedup_claim`,
+  `future_token_signal_allowed`, `local_sota_gguf_receipts_valid`,
+  `research_roadmap_yaml_unchanged`, `conductor_unchanged`,
+  `next_recommendations`, `inference_substrate`, and `honest_verdict`. The
+  default `.494` aggregation must classify Exp5430 structured corrigendum plus
+  Exp5431 structured taxonomy replication as headline-ready, Exp5432
+  ontology/soft-logic memory as headline-ready, Exp5433 active-constraint
+  diversity LNS as bounded, Exp5434 p-bit PolarFire timing variance as bounded
+  with no speedup claim, Exp5435 verified workflow memory plus Exp5436 CSL
+  transfer stress as headline-ready, Exp5437 ARC live reinduction as
+  honest-null/no-bank, Exp5438 KAN ontology certificates as bounded with no
+  broad KAN verification claim, and the token/internal feature lane as blocked.
